purchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["ON.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-10-02 revenue was $1.7 billion, up 11.1% from $1.6 billion in the three months ended 2025-10-03.","cites":["ON.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","ON.d.revenue.2025-07-05.2025-10-03"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-02 revenue added up to $6.4 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $784 million and net income to $689 million.","cites":["ON.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ON.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-10-03","ON.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-04-03","ON.d.revenue.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","ON.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","ON.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ON.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-10-03","ON.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-04-03","ON.d.opinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","ON.d.opinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","ON.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ON.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-10-03","ON.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-04-03","ON.d.netinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","ON.d.netinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.6 billion: operating cash flow of $1.8 billion less capital spending of $153 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["ON.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ON.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-10-03","ON.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-04-03","ON.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-07-03","ON.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-10-02","ON.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ON.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-10-03","ON.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-04-03","ON.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-07-03","ON.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-04-02 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $17.7 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $5.2 million.","cites":["ON.pay.peoTotal.2025","ON.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $6 million in total and $2.7 million actually paid.","cites":["ON.pay.neoTotal.2025","ON.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $165.00 at the end of FY2025, and $268.00 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["ON.pay.tsr.2025","ON.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $7.1 billion at the end of FY2025, against $11.9 billion a year earlier. That is 118.4% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["ON.rpo.2025","ON.rpo.2024","ON.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $122 million at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $219 million a year earlier.","cites":["ON.deferred.2025","ON.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 22,600 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $265,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ON.q.employees","ON.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $667 million, after $134 million in FY2024.","cites":["ON.restructuring.2025","ON.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $2.1 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $400 million in short-term investments, and $3 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $433 million (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["ON.cash.2025","ON.sti.2025","ON.debtLong.2025"]}]},"fin":{"ON":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":31,"read":31,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["GOPALSWAMY SUDHIR","Group President, AMG & ISG"],["Thad Trent","Exec VP & C